    Standardized by ISO in 1984 — seven layers, each depending only on the one directly beneath it. Almost
    nothing implements all seven cleanly in practice, but it's still the shared vocabulary for where something
    happens.
  </p>

  <div class={orderToggleTrack} role="radiogroup" aria-label="Stack reading order" data-order-toggle>
