  <h2 id="derivation" class={sectionH2}>
    <Icon name="columns" size={20} class={css({ color: 'primary' })} /> How TCP/IP's layers are derived
  </h2>
  <p class={bodyP}>
    TCP/IP's four layers aren't a different model — they're OSI's seven, merged. The diagram below lines each
